{"id":"fb6604241f53b69a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-newman-theorem.md","title":"Dirichlet-Series Half-Plane Theorem","display":"thm-dirichlet-series-half-plane — Dirichlet-Series Half-Plane Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-dirichlet-series-half-plane","aliases":["58-thm-dirichlet-series-half-plane","58-thm-newman-theorem","58-df-newman-theorem"],"display":"thm-dirichlet-series-half-plane — Dirichlet-Series Half-Plane Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-sequences]]","[[../batch17/58-df-complex-plane.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md]]","[[58-df-compact]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-dirichlet-series-half-plane"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-dirichlet-series-half-plane</span><span>58-thm-newman-theorem</span><span>58-df-newman-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dirichlet-series-half-plane — Dirichlet-Series Half-Plane Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ea3fa70993b84c0\" href=\"?note=9ea3fa70993b84c0\" title=\"58-df-sequences\">58-df-sequences</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1ea2a066d6d8ddc5\" href=\"?note=1ea2a066d6d8ddc5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-complex-plane.md\">../batch17/58-df-complex-plane.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d60e86f21ed502a\" href=\"?note=5d60e86f21ed502a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md\">../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2d06636b21adf739\" href=\"?note=2d06636b21adf739\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md\">../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(s_0\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,f\\in V\">\\(D,f\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{s_0}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb C:\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;\\operatorname{Re}(s_0)\\}\">\\(H_{s_0}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb C:\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;\\operatorname{Re}(s_0)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> is the standard Euclidean topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S\\)</span> are the exact predicates supplied by the cited dependencies</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}series\\text{-}half\\text{-}plane} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D)\\land s_0\\in D\\to\\Biggl(H_{s_0}\\subseteq D\\land\\forall K\\subseteq H_{s_0}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{K\\cap U:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\}\\bigr)\\to\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in K\\;\\bigl(N\\leq m\\to\\lvert\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-f(s)\\rvert&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S(f\\upharpoonright H_{s_0},H_{s_0},1,1)\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}series\\text{-}half\\text{-}plane} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D)\\land s_0\\in D\\to\\Biggl(H_{s_0}\\subseteq D\\land\\forall K\\subseteq H_{s_0}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{K\\cap U:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\}\\bigr)\\to\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in K\\;\\bigl(N\\leq m\\to\\lvert\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-f(s)\\rvert&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S(f\\upharpoonright H_{s_0},H_{s_0},1,1)\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ordinary convergence of a Dirichlet series at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\">\\(s_0\\)</span> yields the explicitly displayed compact-local uniform convergence, and therefore holomorphy, in the open half-plane to its right.</li>\n<li>This is not Newman's analytic Tauberian theorem and does not by itself provide analytic continuation across the line of convergence or prove a zero-free statement for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\">\\(\\zeta\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sequences","status":"resolved","id":"9ea3fa70993b84c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sequences]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-complex-plane.md","status":"resolved","id":"1ea2a066d6d8ddc5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-complex-plane.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d60e86f21ed502a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d06636b21adf739","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s_0\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"D,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"H_{s_0}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb C:\\operatorname{Re}(s)>\\operatorname{Re}(s_0)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}series\\text{-}half\\text{-}plane} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D)\\land s_0\\in D\\to\\Biggl(H_{s_0}\\subseteq D\\land\\forall K\\subseteq H_{s_0}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{K\\cap U:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\}\\bigr)\\to\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in K\\;\\bigl(N\\leq m\\to\\lvert\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-f(s)\\rvert<\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S(f\\upharpoonright H_{s_0},H_{s_0},1,1)\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"s_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta","display":false}],"bytes":1833,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4327","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-newman-theorem.md|58-thm-newman-theorem]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["9ea3fa70993b84c0","1ea2a066d6d8ddc5","5d60e86f21ed502a","2d06636b21adf739","050f6d05b2c94aea"]}